  "title": "Osiris-Comprehensive Bespoke Atmospheric Model (CBAM) reanalysis-east-africa",
  "description": "The Osiris CBAM (Comprehensive Bespoke Atmospheric Model) reanalysis dataset provides high-resolution (4 km spatial, hourly temporal) agrometeorological data for East Africa. It covers the region from approximately 27\u00b0E to 44\u00b0E, 13\u00b0S to 7\u00b0N, with data beginning in 2012. The dataset has demonstrated improved or comparable skill relative to existing gridded agrometeorological products.",
